EXT. MOUNTAIN TOP - DAY

A lone writer sits at a small wooden desk. The wind HOWLS.

WRITER
(to himself)
Finally, a distraction-free environment.

He types furiously.

INT. WRITER'S CABIN - NIGHT

The same writer, now warm by a fire.

WRITER
And it's all backed by Git.

> THE END <
